  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Assistance to Communities Affected by Typhoon Yagi in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Typhoon Yagi has inflicted severe damage across the northern provinces of Viet Nam, emerging as one of the most impactful storms to affect the region in the past thirty years. The typhoon&apos;s powerful winds and torrential rains have led to widespread devastation, particularly in the mountainous areas, which have borne the brunt of the storm&apos;s impact. Under the overall objective of saving lives and protecting populations severely affected by Typhoon Yagi while strengthening their resilience, the International Organization for Migration is providing emergency and early recovery assistance on demand. at eleven of the hardest-hit provinces prioritized by the government.</narrative>
  </description>
